<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 38-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V PAKISTAN - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 38-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V PAKISTAN - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe, 178 runs</p>
<p>behind Pakistan on first innings, were 38 for one in their</p>
<p>second innings at the close on the fourth day of the first test</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 375 and 38-1, Pakistan 553.</p>
</text>
